  <main_text>
    <l n="1">fumunt, alios provocandi,</l>
    <l n="2">&amp; ita de suis &amp; alterius membris</l>
    <l n="3">disponendi. Cum tamen nemo</l>
    <l n="4">sit membrorum suorum do-</l>
    <l n="5">minus absolutus, nec in</l>
    <l n="6">se ipsum habeat potestatem. Ve-</l>
    <l n="7">rum id competat reipublicæ,</l>
    <l n="8">quæ suprema domina, &amp; mo-</l>
    <l n="9">deratrix; quæ sibi imperium</l>
    <l n="10">in nostra membra, adeoque in</l>
    <l n="11">corpus vindicavit.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">- Peccant in rempublicam,</l>
    <l n="13">dum secundum, tertium, &amp;</l>
    <l n="14">quartum eligunt, adeoque cæ-</l>
    <l n="15">dibus vulgaribus latissimum</l>
    <l n="16">campum adaperiunt. Com-</l>
    <l n="17">munitatem numero subdito-</l>
    <l n="18">rum privant, qui patriæ po-</l>
    <l n="19">tuissent fuisse membra maxi-</l>
    <l n="20">me utilia. Fortium enim vi-</l>
    <l n="21">rorum hinc interitus, qui si</l>
    <l n="22">sanguinem pro patria effudis-</l>
    <l n="23">sent, hostibus fuissent metuen-</l>
    <l n="24">di. Ut haud immerito hic ap-</l>
    <l n="25">plicetur illud Agesilai, qui cum</l>
    <l n="26">vidisset Lacædemonios ipsos Athe-</l>
  </main_text>
